static.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/65edb5a16529df5ffc9854a37287f98736d06c95/ss_65edb5a16529df5ffc9854a37287f98736d06c95.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756227723","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/65edb5a16529df5ffc9854a37287f98736d06c95/ss_65edb5a16529df5ffc9854a37287f98736d06c95.600x338.jpg?t=1756227723"}],"short_description":"Dino Explore is a fun way to learn more about dinosaurs! Do you want to dig up bones? Or maybe you want to find dinosaurs in a 2d world? Are you interested in a dinosaur quiz, challenging your knowledge about dinosaurs or .... maybe you just want to compare sizes. All of this is in the game!","steam_appid":3788740,"support_info":{"email":"nordlowsimon7@gmail.com","url":"https://mygamessimon.my.canva.site/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}